e":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mother of two living on Otomehara island. Kind and maternal, if a little meek. While normally the mild-mannered mom, she also serves as the island’s mediator. Great at all manner of housework. Loves interacting with her beloved daughters."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though due to her somewhat naive nature, she sometimes struggles to keep up with their conversations. Pressured into giving birth at a young age, she and her daughters ran away from her husband when he turned violent, and were taken into Sensei’s custody."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When she first arrived on the island, she was under the impression that she had to sleep with him in order to repay his kindness. But knowing Nanami’s fear of men, Sensei simply admonished her gently."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c107108"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/ba96d28db7bc93e3d2c3bcc20c1960ea1d4739d98ef3160791eb05cbbfafa78d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/92724640b56962535a8522a563027fa4b7fb00e6495df361e70b59aa1a56272c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"星空 ユメ","creatorId":"vndb:s987","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s987","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s987","name":"榎木 実佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:90968","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c107110","characterName":"小若女 真希","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c107110"},"originalCharacterName":"小若女 真希","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Eldest daughter of the Kowakame family. Diligent, with a strong sense of responsibility. Quite enthusiastic about taking care of the protagonist at Sensei’s request."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite her dislike of men as a result of growing up with a violent father, she has nothing but absolute trust in Sensei. While a little wary of Shouichi at first, she was relieved to find his personality resembled Sensei’s—though a bit more timid."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though a romantic at heart, Maki had come to terms with the fact that it wasn’t in the cards for her. But perhaps as a result of this, she finds herself accepting all of Shouichi’s carnal desires without question once he reveals his attraction to her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c107110"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/882ce30cb446756f1fe128b6c16b35d5964d1ef0b831e26fdcf14f3bd13466fb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/764fde79a2b18617b8896ec365ceabca7869685cf714cd4bc4593fbc0c0dc27d.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"麦芽 ぷりん","creatorId":"vndb:s15910","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15910","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15910","name":"小澤 みのり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:90970","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c107112","characterName":"小若女 乃々","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c107112"},"originalCharacterName":"小若女 乃々","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Youngest daughter of the Kowakame family. A little immature for her age, and shy as well."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although grateful to Sensei for helping her family, she sees him more as a kindly grandfather than anything. Nono hides countless adult toys in her room, and her fantasies are spurred on even further when she spies the protagonist having sex with her mom and sister. As a result, she casually begins leading him into compromising situations with her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She enjoys licking, bondage, and other abnormal fetishes. As a matter fact, she’s quite the masochist. Nevertheless, she is rather embarrassed about her kinks, and hides them from Maki and Nanami."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c107112"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4e8bede120b2bada6d99ee86aa822b8f0fcc8ffca86b220098716451cad998c6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36c99dc672508a7568330efaf6f03e69e55df92cc7a35ef59d97280d4078c067.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ハヲリ","creatorId":"vndb:s999","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s999","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s999","name":"間宮 菜南子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:90971","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c112847","characterName":"原間 聖一","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c112847"},"originalCharacterName":"原間 聖一","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c161962","characterName":"母親","sourceIds":{"vndbCharact